# Optional. Route GitHub calls through the serverless proxy in api/github.ts (needs a host that runs it, such as Vercel).
# VITE_API_PROXY=/api/github

# Server-side only (set it in the Vercel project settings, never prefix it with VITE_).
# A token with no scopes is enough, it only lifts the rate limit to 5,000 requests an hour.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=
